@TCR 354[3]. Therefore every true worshipper of the Lord at once sees, acknowledges, and receives, any Truth of faith not previously known to him, as soon as he hears it. The reason is that the Lord is in him, and he in the Lord...

@799[end]. In Heaven all with one accord acknowledge the Lord as the God of Heaven.

