@9538. For everything spiritual ceases in that which is called natural truth; and everything celestial in that which is called natural good; and there they subsist.

@9824. The Divine truth ... in an external form in which the interior things cease. Signification, Explanation.

@--. For that which is outermost not only contains the interior things; but they also cease in it...

